function calendar(d){if(!d.date||!d.time){status.textContent='예식 날짜와 시간을 먼저 입력해 주세요.';return;}const dt=new Date(d.date+'T'+d.time+':00+09:00');if(isNaN(dt))return;const stamp=x=>x.toISOString().replace(/[-:]/g,'').replace(/\.\d{3}Z$/,'Z');const clean=s=>String(s).replace(/\\/g,'\\\\').replace(/\r?\n/g,'\\n').replace(/,/g,'\\,').replace(/;/g,'\\;');const text=['BEGIN:VCALENDAR','VERSION:2.0','PRODID:-//Orae//Wedding//KO','BEGIN:VEVENT','UID:'+d.date+'-'+encode({name1:d.name1,name2:d.name2})+'@orae','DTSTAMP:'+stamp(new Date()),'DTSTART:'+stamp(dt),'DTEND:'+stamp(new Date(dt.getTime()+3600000)),'SUMMARY:'+clean(d.name1+' · '+d.name2+' 결혼식'),'LOCATION:'+clean(d.venue+' '+d.address),'END:VEVENT','END:VCALENDAR'].join('\r\n');download(text,'text/calendar;charset=utf-8','결혼식-일정.ics');}
